# Files excluded from `git archive` distribution tarballs (the public build).
#
# The recommended way to build a public/colleague package is:
#     git archive --format=tar.gz -o ptm3d.tar.gz HEAD
# which honors the `export-ignore` rules below. A raw `tar`/`cp -r` of the
# working tree does NOT honor them and would leak the excluded paths.

# Per-developer Claude/agent settings (may carry local paths and commands).
# Already gitignored, so absent from a clean checkout; belt-and-suspenders for
# archives built from a working tree.
.claude/           export-ignore
gui/.claude/       export-ignore
